      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 168,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3 monedas de $1, 2 de 50 centavos. Se extraen de a 3 al azar sin reposición\na) S = {UUU, UUC, UCU, CUU, CCU, CUC, UCC}\nb) \nP(A) = 4/7\nP(B) = 1/7\nP(C) = 6/7\n",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
